---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Timeline } from "@/components/Timeline";
---

<Layout title="About Me | Daniel's Portfolio">
    <main class="flex flex-col items-center px-6 py-12 md:py-20 lg:py-24">
        <div class="w-full max-w-5xl space-y-8">
            <section class="w-full">
                <h1
                    class="bg-linear-to-r from-foreground via-foreground/90 to-muted-foreground bg-clip-text text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6"
                >
                    About Me
                </h1>
                <div
                    class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"
                >
                    <p>
                        I'm a self-taught Front-End Developer focused on
                        building high-performance React applications and
                        interactive WebGIS platforms.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        My path into tech was a bit unconventional. I learned to
                        code from scratch using resources like Khan Academy,
                        which eventually led to my first role at map.ir. Shortly
                        after I joined, the senior developers moved on to new
                        opportunities, leaving me as the sole front-end
                        developer. Taking ownership of entire codebases so early
                        in my career was a steep learning curve, but it taught
                        me how to adapt quickly, navigate complex architecture,
                        and deliver projects independently.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Today, I bring that same curiosity and persistence to my
                        work, always ready to dive in and figure out new
                        technical challenges.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <Timeline client:visible />
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
